# Exclude env files at any depth (**/*.env) — Docker patterns without '/' are
# root-anchored (unlike gitignore) and miss subdirectories.
# config_sample.env is re-included below; order matters, last match wins.
# Without this file, COPY . . bakes env files and virtualenvs into the image.
.git
.gitattributes
**/*.env
!config_sample.env
**/*.session
**/*.session-journal
**/*.session-shm
**/*.session-wal
Thunder/logs
.venv
venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
.coverage.*
.coverage.json
tests
requirements-dev.txt
pyproject.toml
.github
.gitignore
.python-version
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
AGENTS.md
VPS.md
PLAN.md

